Compile and link shader source, replacing the current program\&. 
.SS "bool sl::Shader::load (const std::string & vertexSource, const std::string & fragmentSource, const std::string & assetId)"
Compile and link a named built-in shader asset, replacing the current program\&. 
.SS "bool sl::Shader::load (const std::string & vertexSource, const std::string & fragmentSource, const std::vector< std::string > & vulkanSamplerNames, const std::vector< \fBShaderUniform\fP > & vulkanUniforms)"
Compile and link an arbitrary custom shader, replacing the current program\&. On Vulkan this compiles the supplied GLSL to SPIR-V at runtime (requires glslangValidator to be installed) and builds a pipeline whose fragment stage samples \fCvulkanSamplerNames\fP (in binding order 0\&.\&.N-1) and exposes \fCvulkanUniforms\fP as named push-constant fields settable via set_uniform\&. The special uniform name 'uProjection' is always available for a 4x4 matrix and does not need to be listed in \fCvulkanUniforms\fP\&. On OpenGL, \fCvulkanSamplerNames\fP and \fCvulkanUniforms\fP are ignored\&. 
.SS "bool sl::Shader::load_compute (const std::string & computeSource)"
Compile and link a compute shader, replacing the current program\&. 
.SS "bool sl::Shader::load_compute (const std::string & computeSource, const std::string & assetId)"
Compile and link a named built-in compute shader asset, replacing the current program\&. 
.SS "bool sl::Shader::load_compute (const std::string & computeSource, const std::vector< \fBShaderUniform\fP > & vulkanUniforms, const std::string & assetId = \fC{}\fP)"
Compile and link a compute shader that uses \fClayout(push_constant)\fP uniforms on Vulkan\&. On Vulkan, \fCvulkanUniforms\fP maps named push-constant fields (matching a block the compute source itself declares) to offsets settable via \fBset_uniform()\fP; the GLSL text must be Vulkan-valid (no loose \fCuniform\fP globals)\&. On OpenGL, \fCvulkanUniforms\fP is ignored and plain \fCuniform\fP globals in the same source work as usual\&. 
.SS "bool sl::Shader::load_compute_file (const std::string & computePath, const std::string & assetId = \fC{}\fP)"
Load and compile a compute GLSL source file\&. 
